###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - No energy, force or stress errors are stated in the main text (training accuracy with max_L = 0 is shown in Fig. S1 of the SM). Lattice parameters, cell volumes, bulk moduli, elastic constants, equation-of-state agreement (within 0.5 meV/atom), supercell energies (within 50 meV/atom, Fig. 5) and phonon-band RMSEs between the two MACE models (0.20 and 0.51 THz) are properties or figure-only.
# - The test-set structures (Tables I and II) are listed, but no test errors are reported in the text.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).
# - Evaluation roles and data, base models, inference timings with their system sizes, and the source location of each value are recorded in the encoding input (artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/arnold2026.yaml) until the schema has terms for them.
